OL,3,AWeekly type 2 diabetes jab could
OL,4,Areplace daily injections
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of thousands of people with
OL,7,Ftype 2 diabetes could get access to a
OL,8,Fnew weekly insulin jab to replace daily
OL,9,Finjections, reducing the number needed
OL,10,Feach year by 86%.
OL,12,FPatients still have to wait for the
OL,13,Ftreatment to be approved by the
OL,14,Fmedicines regulator before it is made
OL,15,Favailable on the NHS.
OL,17,FThe treatment is said to work as well
OL,18,Fas daily insulin jabs but only needs to
OL,19,Fbe injected once a week.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
