OL,3,AWeekly type 2 diabetes jab could
OL,4,Areplace daily injections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity Diabetes UK says it will
OL,7,Fhelp people manage their condition
OL,8,Fbetter, especially those who have extra
OL,9,Fcare needs and who require help to
OL,10,Finject every day.
